NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE. This software can place real orders against a real
brokerage account. Its consensus score is a hand-tuned heuristic that
underperformed buy-and-hold in backtest, and is labelled as such throughout.
Run with WEBULL_ENVIRONMENT=paper until you have rehearsed the approval flow.
You are responsible for every order you approve.

THIRD-PARTY DATA. Series sourced from FRED are redistributed by the Federal
Reserve Bank of St. Louis under the terms of their original publishers. Two
carry third-party copyright and are not licensed for redistribution:
`hy_spread` (ICE BofA index data) and `vix` (CBOE). They are fetched live for
personal use and no values are bundled here.
